      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be great. Currently, I use Udon to calculate the Doppler effect for each AudioSource that requires it. It can be quite taxing when other Udon code is running simultaneously.\n\nFor example, I have around 10 cars on the map, each with approximately 6 AudioSources that require the Doppler effect. These AudioSources can include:\n\nEngine\n\nTurbo\n\nTurbo blow-off\n\nExhaust backfire\n\nFront tire screech\n\nRear tire screech",
      "viewerReactions": null,
